/dist
**/*.rs.bk
!/Cargo.lock
!.cargo/config.toml

/packaging/**/out
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# agent working memory — never documentation, never committed
manager-*-journal.*
# The journal is .txt on purpose: the docs validator scans every *.md in the tree and
# correctly flags anything outside its placement map. Working memory is not documentation and must
# not appear in its verdict.